# teardown with a poll that waits without a limit: the shutdown ends the poll, the worker detaches, the isolate is
# torn down, and the adapter exits with 0.
scenario kit-teardown
requires capability teardown
requires capability async_poll

send endpoint e local_hub
send queue q e Quote
send subscribe q kit-teardown.A
send poll-async q -1
expect await q 200 -> reply pending
send teardown
exit 0
